    "slug": "what-does-a-lead-generation-do",
    "title": "What Does a Lead Generation Virtual Assistant Do?",
    "metaTitle": "What Does a Lead Generation Virtual Assistant Do? | Guide",
    "description": "See what a lead generation virtual assistant can handle, which tasks to delegate, what to keep in-house, and how to define the role before hiring.",
    "excerpt": "A clear breakdown of the recurring lead generation work you can delegate, the boundaries to set, and the signals to look for when hiring.",
    "topic": "seo-marketing",
