        "answer": "When document organization moves from the manager to the Virtual Assistant, day-to-day work should come from a defined queue rather than random requests. For this payroll Virtual Assistant role, that may include timesheet collection, payroll data preparation, employee record updates, and pay-period checklist support. When recurring payroll work includes payroll data preparation, the Virtual Assistant should know where new work appears, what a finished item looks like, and which exceptions need a manager. For teams delegating employee record updates, the exact daily mix depends on your business, so use the role title as a starting point, not as the complete scope."
