          "When recurring sales work includes CRM maintenance, during onboarding, give the Virtual Assistant the smallest access needed for the first workflows. Add permissions only when the scope expands. When follow-up tasks moves from the manager to the Virtual Assistant, that makes troubleshooting and offboarding easier and reduces the chance that convenience turns into unnecessary access."
